Toota Jo Kabhi Tara Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from movie Flying Jatt sung by Atif Aslam & Sumedha Karmahe.

I am sharing 3 different styles of strumming pattern, choose the one you are comfortable with

1] DD UUDUD DU

2] DDUD UUDUD DU

3] DDUD DUUD DDU

